      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We're committed to creating an inclusive environment, but we also recognize that some staff may feel uneasy about adopting mandatory gender-neutral language. To strike a balance, we'll provide guidelines on using inclusive language, but also acknowledge that individuals have different comfort levels with change. We'll offer suggestions for using pronouns in a way that feels authentic and respectful to each person, while also recognizing that some may prefer to use traditional language.",
